    <bpmn:process id="W_W3697" name="W3697. Pricing Accuracy &amp; Price-Override Integrity Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Near-real-time POS events; daily exception report
Frequency: Continuous + daily
Volume: ~2.8M POS transactions/month; ~134M line items/year; 600 terminals
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Merchandising-Pricing
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Merchandising/Pricing (links to VS-01.2), POS/IT (links to VS-08), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3697 — Pricing Accuracy &amp; Price-Override Integrity Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3697_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3697_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3697_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3697_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3697_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3697_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3697_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3697_Start3" name="Near-real-time POS events; daily exception report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3697_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3697_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead monitor shelf-price vs system-price vs charged-price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead monitor shelf-price vs system-price vs charged-price integrity: confirm the price actually charged at POS matches the approved retail/trade/corporate/promo price master (links to VS-01.2/VS-29), detect shelf-label-vs-system price mismatches, and investigate systematic under-ringing
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Pricing / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3697_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3697_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3697_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Store Ops monitor price-override and manual-price-entry…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Store Ops monitor price-override and manual-price-entry integrity: audit override frequency by cashier/store, flag excessive/depth overrides, detect &quot;sale-no-stock&quot; and zero-price anomalies, and investigate potential collusion/sweethearting (links to VS-23.1/W842)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Store Ops / Loss Prevention
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3697_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3697_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3697_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead quantify pricing-leakage: estimate revenue lost to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead quantify pricing-leakage: estimate revenue lost to mis-pricing/over-discounting/under-ringing, drive corrective action (price-lock, override thresholds, cashier coaching), and feed to leak-detection (W3705) and pricing governance (links to VS-01.2)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Pricing
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3697_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3697_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3697_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3697_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3697_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-584 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing, Promotion, Loyalty &amp; Payment Integrity Monitoring (PA-118.2).) | - operational: price-integrity monitoring; operational: override analytics and thresholds
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Merchandising-Pricing</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3697_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3697_Annotation8" targetRef="W3697_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
