    <bpmn:process id="W_W3698" name="W3698. Promotion, Discount &amp; Markdown Integrity Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Promotion event; daily promo-settlement report
Frequency: Per promotion + daily
Volume: 6 major catalog promos/yr + monthly hot deals + bundle/loyalty-exclusive (profile §13.3)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Promotions
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Promotions/Marketing (links to VS-58/VS-14), Merchandising (links to VS-01.2), POS/IT (links to VS-08), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Loyalty (links to VS-13), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3698 — Promotion, Discount &amp; Markdown Integrity Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3698_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3698_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3698_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3698_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3698_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3698_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3698_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3698_Start3" name="Promotion event; daily promo-settlement report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3698_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3698_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Promotions assure promotion setup integrity before and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Promotions assure promotion setup integrity before and during events: verify the promo mechanism (BOGO, % off, bundle price, quantity break) is configured correctly in POS/ecommerce, the eligible items/dates/conditions are right, and the promo applies the intended discount (not more/less)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Promotions / POS-IT
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Per promotion</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3698_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3698_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3698_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead monitor discount/markdown integrity during the event…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead monitor discount/markdown integrity during the event: detect discount-stacking abuse (multiple promos combining beyond intent), over/under-discounting, promo application to ineligible items, and expired promo still live; investigate anomalies (links to W1475 coupon abuse)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Promotions / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily during event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3698_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3698_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3698_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile promo/markdown cost: reconcile promo discount…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile promo/markdown cost: reconcile promo discount given vs budgeted (links to VS-101 markdown budget/VS-39 vendor co-op funding), recover vendor-funded promo where applicable, and report promo-integrity and leakage to merchandising (links to VS-01.2) and leak-detection (W3705)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Promotions / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Per promotion</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3698_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3698_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3698_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3698_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3698_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-584 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing, Promotion, Loyalty &amp; Payment Integrity Monitoring (PA-118.2).) | - operational: pre-event verification; operational: stacking limits and monitoring
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Promotions</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3698_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3698_Annotation8" targetRef="W3698_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
