    <bpmn:process id="W_W3699" name="W3699. Loyalty Points, Gift Card &amp; Stored-Value Integrity" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Points/gift-card transaction stream; daily integrity report
Frequency: Continuous + daily
Volume: ~600K loyalty members; gift-card program; ~2.8M POS transactions
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Loyalty-Gift-Card
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Loyalty (links to VS-13), Gift Card (links to VS-54), Finance (links to VS-17.4), POS/IT (links to VS-08/VS-27), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3699 — Loyalty Points, Gift Card &amp; Stored-Value Integrity</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3699_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3699_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3699_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3699_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3699_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3699_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3699_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3699_Start3" name="Points/gift-card transaction stream; daily integrity report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3699_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3699_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Loyalty assure loyalty-points integrity: verify points…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Loyalty assure loyalty-points integrity: verify points issuance (1 point/PHP 100 per profile §9.2) matches spend, detect over-issuance/duplicate-issuance/manual-point-injection, and verify redemption value is correctly applied and extinguished (links to VS-13)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Loyalty / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3699_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3699_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3699_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Gift-Card assure gift-card/stored-value integrity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Gift-Card assure gift-card/stored-value integrity: monitor gift-card issuance, activation, redemption, balance manipulation, and breakage (links to VS-54); detect gift-card fraud/recycling (links to W1476), balance manipulation, and orphaned-balance leakage
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Gift Card / Loss Prevention
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3699_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3699_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3699_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance reconcile loyalty-liability and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance reconcile loyalty-liability and gift-card-liability to the GL (links to VS-17.4 W1405 PFRS 15 deferred-revenue/breakage), quantify points/gift-card leakage, and report integrity to loyalty/gift-card ops (links to VS-13/VS-54) and leak-detection (W3705)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance / Loyalty
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3699_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3699_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3699_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3699_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
