        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-584 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing, Promotion, Loyalty &amp; Payment Integrity Monitoring (PA-118.2).) | - operational: issuance-integrity monitoring; operational: fraud monitoring (links to W1476)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Loyalty-Gift-Card</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
