    <bpmn:process id="W_W3700" name="W3700. Mandatory Discount &amp; Tax-Exempt Sale Integrity" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Mandatory-discount transaction; daily integrity report
Frequency: Continuous + daily
Volume: Senior Citizen/PWD/Solo Parent discounts across ~2.8M transactions (links to VS-85)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Tax
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Tax (links to VS-79/VS-85), POS/IT (links to VS-08), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), Finance (links to VS-17.3), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3700 — Mandatory Discount &amp; Tax-Exempt Sale Integrity</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3700_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3700_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3700_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3700_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3700_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3700_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3700_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3700_Start3" name="Mandatory-discount transaction; daily integrity report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3700_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3700_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Tax assure mandatory-discount integrity: verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Tax assure mandatory-discount integrity: verify SC/PWD/Solo Parent discounts (5–20%) and VAT-exemption are applied per RA 9994/10524/11861 and correctly computed (discount-then-VAT vs VAT-exempt), detect mis-application (over/under), and verify valid ID/registration (links to VS-85.1)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Tax / POS-IT
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3700_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3700_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3700_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Tax monitor mandatory-discount abuse: detect…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Tax monitor mandatory-discount abuse: detect repeat/fraudulent discount claims, ID misuse, and discount applied to ineligible items/baskets; investigate anomalies and coordinate with loss prevention (links to VS-23) and the mandatory-discount program (links to VS-85)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Tax / Loss Prevention
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3700_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3700_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3700_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Tax reconcile mandatory-discount and tax-credit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead/Tax reconcile mandatory-discount and tax-credit recovery: ensure the discount cost and the recoverable tax-credit (links to VS-85.3) are accurately captured for BIR tax-credit recovery, quantify any leakage (unrecovered credit, mis-computed discount), and report to tax (links to VS-79/VS-85) and leak-detection (W3705)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Tax / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3700_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3700_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3700_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3700_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3700_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-584 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing, Promotion, Loyalty &amp; Payment Integrity Monitoring (PA-118.2).) | - operational: POS logic and integrity check; operational: reconciliation (links to VS-85)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Tax</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
