    <bpmn:process id="W_W3701" name="W3701. Payment, Tender &amp; Settlement Integrity (MDR/Fees)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily settlement; payment-gateway reconciliation
Frequency: Daily + monthly
Volume: ~36% card + ~15% e-wallet + multi-tender (profile §5); ~PHP 5.19B/month
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Payment Operations
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Payment Ops (links to VS-80), Treasury (links to VS-18.1), Finance (links to VS-17.1), POS/IT (links to VS-08), Acquirers/PSPs, BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3701 — Payment, Tender &amp; Settlement Integrity (MDR/Fees)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3701_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3701_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3701_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3701_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3701_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3701_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3701_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3701_Start3" name="Daily settlement; payment-gateway reconciliation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3701_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3701_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Payment Ops verify tender capture integrity: confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Payment Ops verify tender capture integrity: confirm multi-tender/split-payment transactions captured the full basket value across cash/card/e-wallet/charge-account, detect under-tender/tender-mismatch, and reconcile tender totals to sales
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Payment Ops / POS-IT
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3701_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3701_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3701_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Payment Ops audit payment fees: verify MDR (Merchant…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Payment Ops audit payment fees: verify MDR (Merchant Discount Rate) and PSP/e-wallet fees deducted are at contracted rates (links to VS-80.1), detect overcharging/incorrect-tier application, and reconcile settlement net-of-fees to expected (the W348 step-2 fee audit, operationalized)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Payment Ops / Treasury
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3701_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3701_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3701_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile payment settlement: reconcile acquirer/PSP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile payment settlement: reconcile acquirer/PSP settlement timing and amount to POS tender records (links to VS-80.2), investigate settlement gaps/holds/chargebacks, and quantify payment-leakage; report to treasury (links to VS-18) and leak-detection (W3705)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Payment Ops / Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3701_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3701_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3701_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3701_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
