    <bpmn:process id="W_W3702" name="W3702. Catch-Weight, Cut-Length &amp; Measurement-Based Revenue Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Catch-weight/cut-length transaction stream; daily integrity report
Frequency: Continuous + daily
Volume: Lumber/board-foot, wire/meter, nails/bulk, tiles/sq-m, paint-mix (profile §6.4)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Store Ops
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Store Ops (links to VS-07), In-Store Services (links to VS-09), POS/IT (links to VS-08), Quality/Calibration (links to VS-31/VS-115), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3702 — Catch-Weight, Cut-Length &amp; Measurement-Based Revenue Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3702_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3702_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3702_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3702_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3702_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3702_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3702_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3702_Start3" name="Catch-weight/cut-length transaction stream; daily integrity report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3702_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3702_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Store Ops assure measurement-based revenue: verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Store Ops assure measurement-based revenue: verify catch-weight (bulk nails/screws by kg) and cut-length (lumber/board-foot, pipe, wire/meter, sheet) transactions charge for the actual measured quantity × unit price, detect under-weighing/under-measuring or quantity-entry errors, and monitor yield/scrap (links to VS-09.1)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Store Ops / POS-IT
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3702_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3702_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3702_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Calibration assure scale/meter accuracy for revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Calibration assure scale/meter accuracy for revenue: confirm POS scales, lumber measures, wire-length meters, and paint dispensers are calibrated and accurate (links to VS-115), detect out-of-calibration devices causing systematic under/over-charge, and trigger recalibration
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Quality / Calibration
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3702_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3702_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3702_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead quantify measurement-leakage: estimate revenue lost to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead quantify measurement-leakage: estimate revenue lost to under-weighing/under-measuring/out-of-calibration, drive corrective action (recalibration, process fix), and report to store ops (links to VS-07), quality/calibration (links to VS-115), and leak-detection (W3705)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3702_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3702_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3702_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3702_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
