        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-584 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing, Promotion, Loyalty &amp; Payment Integrity Monitoring (PA-118.2).) | - operational: calibration assurance; operational: integrity monitoring
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
