    <bpmn:process id="W_W3703" name="W3703. Ecommerce, Marketplace &amp; 3P Settlement Revenue Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily ecommerce/marketplace settlement; order-volume reports
Frequency: Daily + monthly
Volume: ~42,900 ecommerce orders/month; marketplace 3P seller activity (links to VS-95)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Ecommerce
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Marketplace (links to VS-95/VS-65), Digital Commerce entity (links to VS-72), Payment Ops (links to VS-80), Finance (links to VS-17.1), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3703 — Ecommerce, Marketplace &amp; 3P Settlement Revenue Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3703_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3703_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3703_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3703_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3703_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3703_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3703_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3703_Start3" name="Daily ecommerce/marketplace settlement; order-volume reports">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3703_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3703_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Ecommerce assure ecommerce revenue: reconcile online…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Ecommerce assure ecommerce revenue: reconcile online order value → payment capture → fulfillment → revenue recognition (BOPIS pickup / delivery confirmation per profile §8), detect failed-capture, order-not-fulfilled-but-charged, or charged-but-not-reconciled leakage
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Ecommerce / Payment Ops
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3703_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3703_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3703_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Marketplace assure marketplace/3P revenue: reconcile…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Marketplace assure marketplace/3P revenue: reconcile 3P-seller commission/fee, the BuildRight-as-marketplace-operator take rate, seller payout, and the refund/chargeback impact (links to VS-95.3); detect commission-leakage, seller-fraud, and settlement discrepancy
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Marketplace / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3703_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3703_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3703_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile the intercompany digital-commerce fee: confirm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile the intercompany digital-commerce fee: confirm BuildRight Digital Commerce Inc.&#x27;s per-order fulfillment fee and monthly payment remittance to Depot Inc. (profile §2) reconciles and that revenue is recognized by the correct entity (links to VS-72); report ecommerce/marketplace leakage to leak-detection (W3705)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Digital Commerce / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3703_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3703_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3703_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3703_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3703_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-584 (ensure controlled execution — Pricing, Promotion, Loyalty &amp; Payment Integrity Monitoring (PA-118.2).) | - operational: capture-fulfillment reconciliation; operational: commission reconciliation
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Ecommerce</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
